## 1. [admin] section
### 1.1 POST admin/register-admin [register]
POST http://127.0.0.1:8037/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstname": " ",
  "lastname": " ",
  "email": " ",
  "password": " "
}

### 1.2 POST admin/login [login]
POST http://127.0.0.1:8037/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": " ",
  "password": " ",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### status code 204 is pass
### 1.3 POST admin/forgot-password [forgot password]
POST http://127.0.0.1:8037/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": " "
}

### 1.3.1 POST admin/reset-password [reset password]
POST http://127.0.0.1:8037/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": " ",
  "resetPasswordToken": " "
}

### 1.4 GET admin/users/me [profile & role] use token
GET http://127.0.0.1:8037/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{Token-JWT}}

